    "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate reported a significant gross prior year release of GBP 91.981 million, representing a 47.22% reduction relative to opening gross reserves. This was primarily driven by healthy prior year releases and lower than average attritional loss activity across the Property and Speciality lines of business. While the year experienced a moderately active windstorm season and higher than expected catastrophe losses, these were largely mitigated by the reinsurance programme. Reserves for COVID-19 remained stable, and the 2019 year of account closed with positive claims development. The 2020 year of account also benefited from prior accident year releases and low attritional losses, despite higher than expected catastrophe losses from events like Storm Uri and Hurricane Ida.",
